Monsters have several senses.  Invisibility effects sight and some
monsters see invisibility.  Stealth effects sound and some monsters
can track by sound.  There's also telepathy and infravision.

So to make it progressively more difficult for monsters to track you
you want to be invisible, stealthy, mindless and cold blooded.  That
mindless part is double-plus-ungood for a player character.


